// bindings/module.cpp -- the torch shim.  GENERATED by the 4c apply script
// from the C API's entry table (core/capi.h); the core is reached only through
// that C API: adapt the torch struct, call, map the outputs back by pointer
// identity.  Same Python surface as before (names, tuples, docstrings, the CPU
// fallback for the equations that have one).
